==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Delta Species|Porygon|80}} from the {{TCG|EX Delta Species}} expansion.
*'''Stiffen''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Kakuna|33}} and {{TCG ID|Base Set|Metapod|54}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

